  "notes": "{満|み}ちる means to become full or reach capacity, often used for natural phenomena.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{満|み}たす→満たす：09889_mitasu⟧ (transitive, to fill)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{月|つき}→月：02230_tsuki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{満|み}ちる: the moon becomes full\n- ⟦{潮|しお}→潮：13369_shio⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{満|み}ちる: the tide comes in\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{喜|よろこ}び→喜び：03672_yorokobi⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{満|み}ちる: to be filled with joy\n- ⟦{期間|きかん}→期間：00229_kikan⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{満|み}ちる: a period expires\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{満月|まんげつ}→満月：17598_mangetsu⟧: full moon\n- ⟦{満潮|みちしお}→満潮：noentry⟧/⟦{満|み}ち{潮|しお}→満ち潮：noentry⟧: high tide\n- ⟦{満|み}ち{足|た}りる→満ち足りる：27837_michitariru⟧: to be satisfied\n\nCONTRAST:\n- ⟦{欠|か}ける→欠ける：13167_kakeru⟧: to wane, be lacking",
